    "edit_note": "The cap's bay over a side platform (hand L): the concourse (top 6.20 m over the bed) with the stair down to the platform against the cap wall, and the LIFT beside it (LIFT_0: doors on its X faces at the platform and the concourse). Nothing below 5.90 m may reach past the platform's track edge (-Y face for L): the train passes under the concourse."
